{"id": "clm:f3b459044513f9cd628e4232d09a00c6d46ca87bccb091a13909946a2498721c", "type": "statement", "text": "Tencent recommends restricting index pinning to critical queries because excessive pinning limits adaptation to changing data distributions; test representative parameter values before applying a policy. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://cloud.tencent.com/document/product/240/133522", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["setQuerySettings index hints and queryFramework"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "mechanism", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:fb43fc484daf6d7034f9df8f76f56b07887c796ce9277bfc7e30545a343d57a5", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:13eb5cb3b039095e309d48f40635ff93da30b4c78dc1a9da54b4da1f9c939b6c", "ev:322bf363f9aeb06e9db152b1b884da89f86c9fa7ded7032a30fff31faa94349e"]}
{"id": "clm:98b848eeaa738b01432e862999f7a09ab9fe4c603bff56697cf4d03d96ca5864", "type": "statement", "text": "Index hints restrict candidate indexes but do not guarantee index use: a collection scan can still win. An allow-list alone therefore cannot establish that a shape avoids collection scans. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/v8.0/reference/command/setquerysettings/", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["setQuerySettings index hints and queryFramework"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "problems", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/command/setQuerySettings.md"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:fb43fc484daf6d7034f9df8f76f56b07887c796ce9277bfc7e30545a343d57a5", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:cfad88e27c2be5dca9dc381d153b827b58f7224103f77752750ea549fc711e5a"]}
{"id": "clm:c1cf4f7126ada174bfd32c06d3c48234d973d897f3993186438dafb87783a488", "type": "statement", "text": "Inspect winningPlan.slotBasedPlan in explain output or queryFramework in slow-operation logs to identify the executed engine. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/v8.0/reference/sbe/", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["setQuerySettings index hints and queryFramework"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "problems", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:fb43fc484daf6d7034f9df8f76f56b07887c796ce9277bfc7e30545a343d57a5", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:5f7bf2816ff86ae10109f0fb521f636e98fb4e2c1d95a576f0d50c4b005f2cf4"]}
{"id": "clm:a79b978eb99f68e9936b428b581bdb61ae48c7349fb37229bc1ea724c6163013", "type": "statement", "text": "queryFramework accepts classic or sbe. MongoDB determines SBE eligibility per query and uses classic for ineligible queries; verify the executed engine rather than assuming universal SBE support. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/v8.0/reference/command/setquerysettings/", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["setQuerySettings index hints and queryFramework"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "comparisons", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://www.mongodb.com/docs/v8.0/reference/sbe/"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:fb43fc484daf6d7034f9df8f76f56b07887c796ce9277bfc7e30545a343d57a5", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:544126aaf71906247cced0ae81eb493f416bff3fc50fd3b737ee48612ee5e6cd", "ev:5ce4d48942dfe55e482fac69438d33653520278ea0db10da55d3c16aec897e47"]}
{"id": "clm:d2c2bfa7a89ae4db15b327fdeb8ce359fc23467806fa12a360d2db2ce36f4d87", "type": "statement", "text": "Introduced in MongoDB 8.0, setQuerySettings applies shape-based policies to find, distinct, and aggregate across a cluster; settings survive restarts. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/v8.0/reference/command/setquerysettings/", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["setQuerySettings index hints and queryFramework"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/command/setQuerySettings.md"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:fb43fc484daf6d7034f9df8f76f56b07887c796ce9277bfc7e30545a343d57a5", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:0c319f15e9c07118531e9c9e0ef32612671aa6028d770e3e4acd13cb3e162c55"]}
{"id": "clm:fab5786b85e03460c4c8473daab353134ff4f01d0253901d06ea474331dc5f53", "type": "statement", "text": "Supply a representative command with $db, or an existing query shape hash string, as setQuerySettings; put the policy in the separate settings document. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/v8.0/reference/command/setquerysettings/", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["setQuerySettings index hints and queryFramework"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/command/setQuerySettings.md"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:fb43fc484daf6d7034f9df8f76f56b07887c796ce9277bfc7e30545a343d57a5", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:3f7f864f4daad07bb5773ac084d8c522e92bde2dabe0b4a2bd4ae99612a4ed4d"]}
{"id": "clm:21f8a90d02960602d2fb7d1cf4e6189d91176b8071fd3178aaa8e9fe4e864441", "type": "statement", "text": "indexHints entries identify a namespace through ns.db and ns.coll; allowedIndexes accepts index names, key patterns, or $natural hints. A single entry may omit the array brackets. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/v8.0/reference/command/setquerysettings/", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["setQuerySettings index hints and queryFramework"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/command/setQuerySettings.md"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:fb43fc484daf6d7034f9df8f76f56b07887c796ce9277bfc7e30545a343d57a5", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:64303ab0e36c50bee97b04a86bc009e4352f5528f3eb19cefb81c669319cddfe"]}
{"id": "clm:0198221a66e7010888cde55a36edcce31920a0f416d738609af2853153786a37", "type": "statement", "text": "Matching query settings with index hints override command-level index hints; changing a command hint does not change its query shape. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/v8.0/reference/command/setquerysettings/", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["setQuerySettings index hints and queryFramework"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/command/setQuerySettings.md"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:fb43fc484daf6d7034f9df8f76f56b07887c796ce9277bfc7e30545a343d57a5", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:5edddc0040b5959c3282bba7e4f2b988fd99016b49f3d0dec117f5598ddf4dfa"]}
{"id": "clm:f73833032b9d23687c82d120eb18e34ebf62cc26608f77d7c10d7406ba004309", "type": "statement", "text": "reject: true rejects new matching queries but leaves running operations unaffected. Index hints and queryFramework appear alongside reject in the same settings document. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/v8.0/reference/command/setquerysettings/", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["setQuerySettings index hints and queryFramework"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/command/setQuerySettings.md"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:fb43fc484daf6d7034f9df8f76f56b07887c796ce9277bfc7e30545a343d57a5", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:47a863b1783c95d9f2cd1332523b32869bc1a3c88f313e2e827ef1df20b26a98", "ev:d80c6401d5a4e6c818ccaa1f66e95dfc501e674de8ce3c4835517fca81355339"]}
{"id": "clm:df8f5b686513e60ee26a0f1985a5dba17a55a9b1c84312f4f924d5daa6a060b8", "type": "statement", "text": "Inspect applied policies with $querySettings and the querySettings information in explain output, including per-shard entries where shown, then inspect the winning plan to confirm the selected access path. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/v8.0/reference/command/setquerysettings/", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["setQuerySettings index hints and queryFramework"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://cloud.tencent.com/document/product/240/133522"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:fb43fc484daf6d7034f9df8f76f56b07887c796ce9277bfc7e30545a343d57a5", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:2d308ae8ccd38ce5568598b0c83b6dae327f7afd8c7fd20b49fd61fad86c7efa", "ev:a942f6e9ed7356c79f01d63ea0ffabf1b90e9fba91d6e77766bcadf05b32458d", "ev:ed2053adb33f2745eee77560bbccd53c4e1707a32f02596e949c4b3a19ba0dc1"]}
{"id": "clm:771e531884b3e4149af5364b01c388a02b3a3d98daf6fd8e5209865fb4747e68", "type": "statement", "text": "Percona ClusterSync documentation dated 2026-10-13 says it does not automatically migrate persistent query settings. Export them with $querySettings and apply them separately on the destination. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-31)", "source_url": "https://docs.percona.com/percona-clustersync-for-mongodb/pqs.html", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["setQuerySettings index hints and queryFramework"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:fb43fc484daf6d7034f9df8f76f56b07887c796ce9277bfc7e30545a343d57a5", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:0233f367bc3979b1ea2bd9adc8fb8bca109da0b6729850ebda4dfd0f5d0b1e48", "ev:9f607376dca04d01b15faad55bab232ae3231394deab2987652b97a5da9a64ad", "ev:c147ff4664ec9dae05e51a27a5a3ce9f63cf059a920bffb26ee5aa56580acb31"]}
{"id": "clm:910945a11aba2e58ec8ab72917cf3a477e8327fc34b2d6ab722b2ed500e586de", "type": "statement", "text": "SERVER-89299 records a historical bug where repeating setQuerySettings for a $setWindowFields pipeline produced different queryShapeHash values and multiple configurations. The issue lists 8.0.0-rc3 among its fixes; it is not evidence of a current unfixed 8.0 defect. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-31)", "source_url": "https://jira.mongodb.org/browse/SERVER-89299", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["setQuerySettings index hints and queryFramework"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:fb43fc484daf6d7034f9df8f76f56b07887c796ce9277bfc7e30545a343d57a5", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:b7cdba6c1ce246798b756af6365a3d68710f43f5110ef3b50f1ceac007c15b03"]}
